# expect: shows one value and takes no children
#
# `Prose` is the no-children element the merge of build-time capabilities
# with the emitter-in-`zdc check` change put under scrutiny: the rule lives
# in `zdc-codegen`, so before `check` ran the emitter only `build` refused
# this. Both refuse it now, and this program is what keeps that true.
state doc is static Markup from build markdown "# hello"

view
    Column
        Prose doc
            Text "nested"
